<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Blinding Spit</ansi> mutation

Glands beneath your tongue produce a caustic, irritating fluid that
you can project with startling accuracy. The constant taste of bile
makes social interactions unpleasant.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Mouth (salivary glands)
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active Ability
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Active ability: spit caustic fluid to temporarily blind a single
  target

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Significantly reduced charisma — the chemical smell and oily sheen
  are deeply off-putting

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
